  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/337cba09b098a129c60c88ca431dc00f7470bb1b39c1452e8d81688a7d6b6b0e.png] \n\nLet's check each option using above BODMAS table:\n\n1. ×, +, –, ÷, =\n\nGiven equation: 13 * 5 * 60 * 6 * 11 * 64\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n13 × 5 + 60 - __**6 ÷ 11**__ = 64\n\n__**13 × 5**__ + 60 - 0.545 = 64\n\n__**65 **____**+ 60**__ - 0.545 = 64\n\n125 - 0.545 = 64\n\n124.455 ≠ 64\n\n2. **×, +, ÷, –, =**\n\nGiven equation: 13 * 5 * 60 * 6 * 11 * 64\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n13 × 5 +__** 60 ÷ 6**__ - 11 = 64\n\n__**13 × 5**__ + 10 - 11 = 64\n\n__**65 + 10**__ - 11 = 64\n\n75 - 11 = 64\n\n**64 = 64**\n\n3. +, –, ×, ÷, =\n\nGiven equation: 13 * 5 * 60 * 6 * 11 * 64\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n13 + 5 - 60 × __**6 ÷ 11**__ = 64\n\n13 + 5 - __**60 × 0.545**__ = 64\n\n__**13 + 5**__ - 32.727 = 64\n\n18 - 32.727 = 64\n\n-14.727 ≠ 64\n\n4. –, +, ×, ÷, =\n\nGiven equation: 13 * 5 * 60 * 6 * 11 * 64\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n13 - 5 + 60 × __**6 ÷ 11**__ = 64\n\n13 - 5 + __**60 × 0.545**__ = 64\n\n13 - 5 + 32.727 = 64\n\n40.727 ≠ 64\n\nHence, ‘×, +, ÷, –, =’ is the correct answer.",
